      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "A single continuous shot in a warm stylized 3D animated family film, using the provided image as the first frame. Preserve Maxi's brown bob haircut, blue eyes, round amber glasses, mustard shirt and teal overalls throughout. Maxi gently pats the little sand arch, then watches a tiny trickle of sand crumble from its edge. Maxi pauses, takes a breath, and gives a small determined smile, ready to try again. Keep the castle in place and the hand movement small and natural. The camera makes a very slow, subtle push forward at the child's eye level. Warm sunlight and the soft ocean background remain steady. No cuts or additional characters. Audio: quiet beach waves, a light sandy crumble and a soft breath. No spoken dialogue, no music, no captions.",
        "width": 608,
        "height": 352,
        "length": 124
      }
